{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Pochard Jamie&quot;</strong> is a platform action-puzzle game. The diving duck Jamie encounters numerous difficulties during migration. Unlock new levels, scenes, and items to help Jamie complete his mysterious migratory journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[ WASD ] or [ \u2191\u2193\u2194 ]\u00a0 -- <strong>Move</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[ Space ] -- <strong>Jump</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[ Left Click ] or [ Z ] -- <strong>Attak</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Box-pushing is the core gameplay. The scenes contain various types of boxes\u2014ordinary boxes can be pushed simply by attacking, while special boxes, such as those with mechanisms, require triggering specific conditions to move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840320/extras/3852d3db7a7e34001981905edb0c8c1e.avif?t=1768013763\" width=430 height=252 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Directionality</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some boxes are marked with directional arrows and will move in that direction when attacked. When Jamie changes his horizontal direction, the box's direction will also change. Some boxes, however, have no directionality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840320/extras/73f9b36f3dd5a0c890ba1b33518f0a23.avif?t=1768013763\" width=430 height=252 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"New!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3840320/fbc92df4d802a8e1f080e423e54fe8beb11e6e7e.jpg"},{"name":"Unknown Plains","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/ap